<title>UK: Telkom at $29.625 in London.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $29.625 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $29.625 in London on Friday. It recorded the day's low of $29.5 and the day's high of $29.625.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Thursday as $29.3750.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
